  Text: "He doesn't know how to open the cargo. \n \nHis orders were to deliver the
    <link>truck</link> and give a code on arrival: \r\n\n\"It went like this: <link>285-P9AQ</link>,
    followed by 3 weird shapes. Never saw them before.\"\r\n\r\nHe is still way too
    shaky from the crash to draw them for us, but he described them like this:\r\n\r\n1.
    a cheerleader\r\n2. a cats butt\r\n3. a falling ghost"
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
